@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@targetKey = REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_USER_KEY

### Follow (duplicate: 409, self: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/following/{{targetKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unfollow (idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/following/{{targetKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Active followers; pass nextCursor for the next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetKey}}/followers?cursor=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Active followings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetKey}}/followings?cursor=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Profile includes active relationship counts and requester following flag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
